        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy baabuúwós guri báy, «Fu'unaydaá sluqoorók huwang, ngiwa /aay, as uwa tsuuq.» Yakobo guri muruú /aymaadá' i huúw, iri /ayín, difaái sleeme gay huúw, gari wáh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An qoomár baabuúwós Isaka iwa oó', «Suruukáng, diirí tseewuwang garmaaeé', án ma'aasáng.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Yakobo iri suruúk dír baabuúwós, guri ma'aás. Baabuúwós xarángw tlabaawós nguwa sláy, guri tsuúq, i kaahi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka Yakobo tsuuqaro nguwa hhe'eés, nee Yakobo hamtidár kilae niwa ti'iít dír baabuúwose, Esau hhiyoó Yakobo nina harakií/ baraá slaktuú wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau sleeme muruú /aymaadá' tsuú' guri adaá tleéhh, guri baabuúwós i huúw, guri báy, «Gím baabá, tlawáng, sluqór garmaawók /ayeek, as án iwa tsuq.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
